  "title": "Formatter regresses a correctly-heard brand name to a dictionary word",
  "why_real": "ASR captured the brand name 'Fiverr' correctly, but the formatter's language model dropped the doubled letter and wrote the more common word-shaped spelling instead.",
  "setup": {
